# fixedbugs, defect 157 widened, lane land186, 2026-10-02, the shape beside
# the handle at depth one: a record NAMED for the union's tag, with no
# `tag`, whose bare name C reads as a type's. It was told *declares no
# `utag`*; the note now names the typedef that makes the same record bind.

extern "fixedbugs-157-unions.h"
    record utag  #~ ffi_tag_is_a_union
        i: i32
    function make_u() -> utag

function main()
    print(make_u().i)
